---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';

const effectiveDate = 'October 16, 2026';
---

<Base
	title="Privacy Policy | Tacoma Tipton"
	description="How Tacoma Tipton collects, uses and protects information on tacomatipton.com."
>
	<SiteHeader />

	<main class="section">
		<article class="container prose">
			<span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="prose-meta">Effective {effectiveDate}</p>

			<p>
				This policy explains what information Tacoma Tipton ("we," "us") collects when you visit
				tacomatipton.com, how we use it, and the choices you have.
			</p>

			<h2>Information we collect</h2>
			<h3>Information you give us</h3>
			<p>
				When you contact us through the website form, we collect your name, email address, phone number (if you
				provide it), the topic you choose, your rental address (for resident requests) and your message.
			</p>
			<h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
			<p>
				Our website hosting provider may record standard server logs, including IP addresses, for security and
				reliability.
			</p>

			<h2>How we use information</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>To answer your questions about renting a home from us.</li>
				<li>To schedule and complete repairs and respond to residents.</li>
				<li>To keep the site secure and prevent abuse.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for third-party advertising.</p>

			<h2>Service providers</h2>
			<p>We rely on a small number of providers to run this site. They process information on our behalf:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong>: hosting for this website.</li>
				<li><strong>Supabase</strong>: secure storage of messages sent through the contact form.</li>
				<li><strong>Resend</strong>: delivery of internal notification emails about new requests.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We may also disclose information if required by law, or to protect the rights, safety and security of
				Tacoma Tipton, our residents or others.
			</p>

			<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
			<p>
				We keep messages for as long as we need them to respond to you and manage our homes, or until you ask us to
				remove them.
			</p>

			<h2>Your choices</h2>
			<p>
				To see, update or delete the information you've sent us, reply to any email from us and we'll take care of
				it. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights to access, correct or delete your personal
				information, and we'll respond to any such request.
			</p>

			<h2>Security</h2>
			<p>
				We use reasonable safeguards to protect your information. Messages can be sent from the website but cannot
				be read back through it. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, however.
			</p>

			<h2>Children</h2>
			<p>This site is intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>

			<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
			<p>If we update this policy, we'll post the new version here and change the effective date above.</p>
		</article>
	</main>

	<SiteFooter />
</Base>
